{"book":17,"chapter":19,"rubric":"OVIRT: THE PLATFORM CORE / CHAPTER 19","slides":[{"title":"Adding a host","sub":"Chapter 19 · oVirt hosts","short":"Adding","main":"SSH, deployment by Ansible playbooks, packages, and certificates.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["SSH","Ansible","Packages","Certificates"],"captions":["The administrator gives an address and credentials, the engine logs in over SSH","Deployment: in 4.4 and newer these are Ansible playbooks","VDSM, libvirt and QEMU packages are installed, the management network is set up","The engine issues certificates from its CA; on failure the status is InstallFailed"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"address + password or key over SSH","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"address + password or key over SSH","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"Ansible playbooks (host-deploy)","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"address + password or key over SSH","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"Ansible playbooks (host-deploy)","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"vdsm, libvirt, QEMU, ovirtmgmt network","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"address + password or key over SSH","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"Ansible playbooks (host-deploy)","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"vdsm, libvirt, QEMU, ovirtmgmt network","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":180.0,"y":122.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"certificates from the engine CA","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[11.1,19.0,30.1]}]},{"title":"Two VDSM daemons","sub":"Chapter 19 · oVirt hosts","short":"Daemons","main":"vdsmd, supervdsmd, and JSON-RPC over TLS on port 54321.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["vdsmd","supervdsmd","JSON-RPC","Client and log"],"captions":["vdsmd runs as an ordinary user and accepts the engine's commands","supervdsmd runs as root: network, mounting, devices","The engine talks to vdsmd over JSON-RPC on top of TLS, port 54321","vdsm-client makes the same calls by hand, the log is /var/log/vdsm/vdsm.log"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"vdsmd\nuser vdsm","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"vdsmd\nuser vdsm","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"supervdsmd\nas root","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"vdsmd\nuser vdsm","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"supervdsmd\nas root","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"JSON-RPC\nTLS :54321","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"vdsmd\nuser vdsm","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"supervdsmd\nas root","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"JSON-RPC\nTLS :54321","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":265.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"vdsm-client\nvdsm.log","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[8.4,15.1,23.6]}]},{"title":"Reports 