":"Power management","sub":"Chapter 19 · oVirt hosts","short":"Power","main":"Fence agents, a second agent, and a proxy host to run the command.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Agents","Two PSUs","Proxy","Order"],"captions":["A fence agent from fence-agents: ipmilan, iLO, DRAC, APC; address, login, password","For a server with two power supplies, a second agent is added","The command is run not by the engine but by another host in Up status","Proxy search order: own cluster, own data center, another data center"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"fence agent:\nipmilan, ilo, drac","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"fence agent:\nipmilan, ilo, drac","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"second agent\nfor 2 PSUs","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"fence agent:\nipmilan, ilo, drac","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"second agent\nfor 2 PSUs","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"proxy: a host\nin Up status","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":95.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"fence agent:\nipmilan, ilo, drac","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":265.0,"y":50.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"second agent\nfor 2 PSUs","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":95.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"proxy: a host\nin Up status","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":265.0,"y":110.0,"w":158.0,"h":46.0,"text":"cluster → DC\n→ other DC","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[13.3,23.2,34.3]}]},{"title":"The fencing process","sub":"Chapter 19 · oVirt hosts","short":"Fencing","main":"Cluster policy, soft fencing, then power.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Candidate","Policy","Soft","Power"],"captions":["A NonResponsive host became a candidate: two failures and 60 seconds","Policy: skip on a fresh lease, on a lost share of hosts, or on live Gluster bricks","Soft fencing: vdsmd is restarted over SSH","Power: switch off, check that the host is off, switch on"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"candidate: 2 failures + 60 s","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"candidate: 2 failures + 60 s","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"policy: lease, % of hosts, Gluster","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"candidate: 2 failures + 60 s","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"policy: lease, % of hosts, Gluster","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"soft: restart vdsmd over SSH","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}],[{"t":"cell","id":"n0","x":180.0,"y":26.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"candidate: 2 failures + 60 s","tone":"yellow","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n1","x":180.0,"y":58.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"policy: lease, % of hosts, Gluster","tone":"violet","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n2","x":180.0,"y":90.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"soft: restart vdsmd over SSH","tone":"blue","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"n3","x":180.0,"y":122.0,"w":280.0,"h":24.0,"text":"power: off → check → on","tone":"green","size":9.0,"sub_size":8.5}]],"cues":[11.2,24.6,31.4]}]},{"title":"After fencing","sub":"Chapter 19 · oVirt hosts","short":"After","main":"HA restarts, a new